d":"c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai","book_id":"b-liangshu-002","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai-ws2401748"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p008:r0088","surface":"豫章王","start":88,"end":91,"person_id":"syn_jn4_wiu","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p008","quote":"天監初，除散騎常侍、領步兵校尉、兼起部尚書。高祖嘗於宴席問羣臣曰：「朕爲有爲無？」份對曰：「陛下應萬物爲有，體至理爲無。」高祖稱善。出爲宣城太守，轉吳郡太守，遷寧朔將軍、北中郎豫章王長史、蘭陵太守，行南徐府州事。遷太常卿、太子右率、散騎常侍，侍東宮，除金紫光祿大夫。復爲智武將軍、南康王長史，秩中二千石。復入爲散騎常侍、金紫光祿、南徐州大中正，給親信二十人。遷尚書左僕射，尋加侍中。","note":"北中郎豫章王為蕭綜。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangfen-ws1544250"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p003:r0294","surface":"豫章王","start":294,"end":297,"person_id":"syn_jn4_wiu","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun:p003","quote":"高祖霸府建，以泰爲驃騎功曹史。天監元年，遷秘書丞。齊永元末，後宮火，延燒秘書，圖書散亂殆盡。泰爲丞，表校定繕寫，高祖從之。頃之，遷中書侍郎。出爲南徐州別駕從事史，居職有能名。復徵中書侍郎，敕掌吏部郎事。累遷給事黃門侍郎、員外散騎常侍，並掌吏部如故，俄卽真。自過江，吏部郎不復典大選，令史以下，小人求競者輻湊，前後少能稱職。泰爲之不通關求，吏先至者卽補，不爲貴賤請囑易意，天下稱平。累遷爲廷尉，司徒左長史。出爲明威將軍、新安太守，在郡和理得民心。徵爲寧遠將軍，安右長史，俄遷侍中。尋爲太子庶子、領步兵校尉，復爲侍中。仍遷仁威長史、南蘭陵太守，行南康王府、州、國事。王遷職，復爲北中郎長史、行豫章王府、州、國事，太守如故。入爲都官尚書。泰能接人士，士多懷泰，每願其居選官。頃之，爲吏部尚書，衣冠屬望，未及選舉，仍疾，改除散騎常侍、左驍騎將軍，未拜，卒，時年四十五。諡夷子。","note":"依本段敘事及王府原卷。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangtai-wangyun-ws1544250"},{"id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng-wyd:p002:r0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"豫章王","person_id":"syn_jn4_wiu","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng-wyd:p002","quote":"豫章王記室","referent_role":"third_person","note":"列早官在中大通元年以前。南史53、梁55見蕭綜先封，531年始封歡，據此暫繫綜。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng-wyd","book_id":"b-liangshu-050","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-050-xiezheng-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng:p002:r0073","start":73,"end":76,"surface":"豫章王","person_id":"syn_jn4_wiu","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng:p002","quote":"豫章王記室","referent_role":"third_person","note":"列早官在中大通元年以前。南史53、梁55見蕭綜先封，531年始封歡，據此暫繫綜。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng","book_id":"b-liangshu-050","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-050-xiezheng-ws1514482"},{"id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p001:r0000","surface":"豫章王","start":0,"end":3,"person_id":"syn_jn4_wiu","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p001","quote":"豫章王綜字世謙，武帝第二子也。天監三年，封豫章郡王。累遷北中郎將、南徐州刺史。","note":"依本段敘事及王府原卷。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai","book_id":"b-nanshi-053","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai-ws1518868"},{"id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p001:r0010","surface":"第二子","start":10,"end":13,"person_id":"syn_jn4_wiu","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p001","quote":"豫章王綜字世謙，武帝第二子也。天監三年，封豫章郡王。累遷北中郎將、南徐州刺史。","note":"史傳列名義第二子；本卷另載宮中所疑。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai","book_id":"b-nanshi-053","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai-ws1518868"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p002","text":"甲辰，以南徐州刺史豫章王綜爲郢州刺史，輕車將軍南康王績爲南徐州刺史。","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p002:m0012","surface":"綜","start":12,"end":13,"person_id":"syn_jn4_wiu","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-002-nanxu-wangtai:p002:m0026","surface":"績","start":26,"end":27,"person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_C","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2401748,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":220,"last_line":220,"line_start":69,"line_end":103,"raw_start":8462,"raw_end":8496,"raw_character_offsets":[8462,8463,8464,8465,8